@page "/privacy"

<PageTitle>Privacy — Blackpool Ballers League</PageTitle>

<div class="privacy-page">
    <h1>Privacy Notice</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: 30 May 2026</p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
        Blackpool Ballers League ("we", "us") operates this website to manage fixtures,
        squads, statistics and league administration for our five-a-side football league.
        Contact: <a href="mailto:stuartbradleyDeveloper@gmail.com">stuartbradleyDeveloper@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Account data:</strong> email address, team name, password (stored hashed).</li>
        <li><strong>Player profile data:</strong> name, position, photo (where uploaded).</li>
        <li><strong>Match data:</strong> goals, cards, fairplay ratings.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical logs:</strong> server-side error and request logs, retained for up to 7 days.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
        We use a single strictly-necessary cookie named <code>Baller.Auth</code> to keep you
        signed in after you log in. It is encrypted, HTTP-only, and expires after 8 hours
        of inactivity. We do not set any tracking, analytics or advertising cookies.
    </p>

    <h2>Lawful basis</h2>
    <p>
        We process your data on the basis of <em>legitimate interest</em> (running the league)
        and <em>contract</em> (providing your account and team management features).
    </p>

    <h2>Sharing</h2>
    <p>
        We do not sell your data. Player names, stats and uploaded photos are visible to
        other site users as part of the league's normal operation. Server hosting and email
        delivery is provided by third-party providers acting as data processors on our behalf.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
        You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data at any
        time by emailing <a href="mailto:stuartbradleyDeveloper@gmail.com">stuartbradleyDeveloper@gmail.com</a>.
        You also have the right to complain to the UK Information Commissioner's Office
        (<a href="https://ico.org.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>).
    </p>

    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <p>
        Account and league data are retained while your team is active in the league. On
        deletion request, personal data is removed within 30 days; aggregate match statistics
        may be retained in anonymised form.
    </p>
</div>
